---
/** Message: two turns of a conversation: a received bubble beside its author, and the reply in ink at the other end. */
---

<span class="cover-stack" style="width:208px; --gap:10px">
  <span class="cover-line" style="align-items:flex-end">
    <i class="cover-avatar cover-avatar-photo" style="--d:28px"></i>
    <span class="cover-bubble cover-stack" style="padding:13px 14px"><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:112px"></i><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:72px"></i></span>
  </span>
  <span class="cover-bubble cover-bubble-sent cover-end" style="padding:15px 14px"><i class="cover-bar" style="width:88px"></i></span>
</span>
